      "order": "After ground tiles, cliff bases, and stair ramps; before top overlays (clouds, etc.).",
      "ySort": true,
      "note": "Water rocks share the y-sorted props layer with land props (trees, bushes, ground rocks). Because they sit on water cells, they render behind land props at the same y-sort position in practice."
    }
  },
  "layeringNote": "Water rocks use the same props render layer and y-sort rules as trees, bushes, and ground rocks. They are placed on water cells only, so they appear below adjacent land props when both occupy nearby rows.",
